Netflix Data Science Internship Project

Project Overview

This repository contains my Data Science internship work completed as part of the Auspify Technologies Internship Program.

The project uses the Netflix dataset to explore data analysis, recommendation systems, and trend prediction through practical data science tasks.

Project Tasks

Task 1 – Data Cleaning

- Data preprocessing and cleaning
- Handling missing values
- Preparing the dataset for analysis

Task 2 – Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)

- Exploring the Netflix dataset
- Analyzing patterns and trends
- Extracting meaningful insights through data analysis

Task 3 – Recommendation System

- Developing a recommendation system
- Exploring recommendation approaches using Netflix data

Task 4 – Trend Prediction

- Analyzing historical trends
- Exploring trend patterns
- Building a trend prediction workflow

Dataset

Netflix Movies and TV Shows Dataset

Project Domain

- Data Science
- Data Analytics
- Machine Learning
- Exploratory Data Analysis
- Recommendation Systems
- Trend Prediction

